y from ground robots or hiding from flying bots under low platforms. But watch out for room hazards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, side-scrolling bullet hell action across 50+ rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of sci-fi and pop culture easter eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip a variety of fun weapons to take on a variety of silly challenges that are as silly as they are challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can Bizness when the time is right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've made it this far, why are you still reading? Go wishlist the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of memorable NPCs to discover and befriend.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "AI has possessed everything. Toasters, telephones, and trash cans have come alive and want you dead. Fight back with a bizarre array of weapons, from bouncy balls to banana guns. Battle through deadly arenas and make strange allies in this action roguelike, as you uncover an apocalyptic conspiracy.",
